@prefix solid: <http://www.w3.org/ns/solid/terms#> .
@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ldp:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .
@prefix vcard: <http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#> .

# Applied at container CREATION (apply.py block 8), BEFORE bootstrap content
# (block 9b). Constraining at creation lets the overlay seed conformant contacts
# (the marie-curie bridge) into this container — CSS H400s any attempt to
# (re)constrain a NON-empty container, so the post-creation block-11 patch path
# cannot be used once a bootstrap contact is present. Mirrors how wiki-memory
# constrains its content containers at creation (containers/wiki/people/.meta).
<> a ldp:Container, ldp:BasicContainer ;
   solid:forClass vcard:Individual ;
   ldp:constrainedBy </vault/meta/shapes/contact-card.shacl.ttl> .
